/usr/bin/<command>, and each path is now registered\nindependently.\n\nCommitted by an AI agent (Claude Code) on behalf of Arshia Ghafoori.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(virtual-fs): back synthetic mount parents in the enclosing mount\n\nA directory that only exists because a deeper mount sits below it (e.g.\n/usr for a mount at /usr/local/ssl) stats as a directory, but mkdir\n/usr/bin or creating /usr/x failed with ENOENT because the directory was\nnever present in the enclosing filesystem. create_dir and create-mode\nopens now create those directories in the nearest enclosing mount first.\n\nCommitted by an AI agent (Claude Code) on behalf of Arshia Ghafoori.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(wasix): cover command aliases below and at nested mounts\n\nWith synthetic mount parents now backed, a mount at /usr/local/ssl no\nlonger blocks /usr/bin aliases. Independent registration is still\nexercised by mounting directly at /usr/bin or /bin.\n\nCommitted by an AI agent (Claude Code) on behalf of Arshia Ghafoori.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Arshia Ghafoori <arshia001@live.com>", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T11:50:38Z", "author": {"name": "Syrus Akbary", "email": "me@syrusakbary.com"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com"}}, "repository": {"id": 152572186, "node_id": "MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxNTI1NzIxODY=", "name": "wasmer", "full_name": "wasmerio/wasmer", "private": false, "owner": {"login": "wasmerio", "id": 44205449, "node_id": "MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjQ0MjA1NDQ5", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44205449?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/wasmerio", "html_url": "https://github.com/wasmerio", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/wasmerio/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/wasmerio/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github